cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use G2Egrid in academic work, please cite it using the metadata
  below (and, for the small-signal modelling method, the reference article
  listed under "references").
title: "G2Egrid: small-signal dq modelling of power systems with a high share of power electronics"
abstract: >-
  G2Egrid is a tool for the small-signal dq modelling of power systems with a
  high share of power electronics. Each piece of equipment declares a
  symbolic DAE model; the network assembles them into a global state-space
  model (A, B, C, D) from which modal analysis, sensitivities, impedances,
  continuation and time-domain simulation are derived. Python successor of
  G2ELIN (MATLAB).
type: software
version: 0.1.0
